\caption{Entity construction threshold sensitivity ($N{=}8$, Qwen3-8B, $T{=}1.0$). $\Delta$: F1 difference vs.\ greedy in percentage points. Best $\Delta$ per dataset--weighting pair in \textbf{bold}.}
